%SIXMD 1
# @?FREE - PRINT MEMORY SUMMARY

## DESCRIPTION

FREE PRINTS TOTAL CORE, PERMANENT RESIDENT WORDS, PROCESS WORDS, MEMFS WORDS,
AND ANY REMAINING UNACCOUNTED WORDS REPORTED BY THE KERNEL.
USAGE IS 'FREE'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
